$ the left wing + canard splines, so per-wing attribution keeps them out)
SET1, 1320, 111, 112, 121, 122
AECOMP, WINGEA, SET1, 1320
$ Whole-aircraft spline-load grids (every grid any spline transfers force to,
$ and every CONM2-bearing grid — grid 97 carries mass but no spline load, and
